 row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}17 \\\\ 7\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot 5\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}17 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043216/assets/6d470181fba760868835a72c5d5cfec3c90f9bf7bf7a9d86860dc8d981517652.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043216/example-4397.json" "file_sha256" "abd2e527a9ca2fe3af66149193cbed9e9d699133e1219ff457eed9787c136e88"} {"question" "e-4398" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043216/assets/1c38a037a66a5f86fd38a2b9ea6226420e455d5ef66fe776af7548fb6724841f.png)\nand\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043216/assets/ffec9e0757e75cad35bbec65fb15d07eb580274c8beb4a9b3337d31cf964ec1c.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14043216/example-4398.json" "file_sha256" "b2543f71748af6a418772de8d36373787d4bba384f61eba9fbf3072749581413"} {"question" "e-4398" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(-3)\\cdot 1+1\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 0 \\\\ 2\\cdot 1+0\\cdot (-2)+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 1+(-2)\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3-2+0 \\\\ 2+0+0 \\\\ -1+4+0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "c